From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:16:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: samsung,mipi-dsim: Add Exynos9820

The Exynos9820 DSI host takes a single clock, "bus": everything else the
block needs is gated inside it, and the PLL lives in a separate D-PHY
device that the node points at with phys.

The narrower clock count is written as a branch, and the two clock
minimum the other compatibles have today moves into the matching else
branch rather than staying at the top level. A conditional cannot loosen
a constraint stated for every node: allOf is a conjunction, so a top
level minItems of 2 would keep rejecting the new node no matter what the
branch says.

Requiring phys is likewise confined to the new compatible. Two of the
existing ones, fsl,imx8mm-mipi-dsim and fsl,imx8mp-mipi-dsim, have no
phys property at all.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 .../display/bridge/samsung,mipi-dsim.yaml     | 40 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 38 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/samsung,mipi-dsim.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/samsung,mipi-dsim.yaml
index ad279f0993f..62ce58e0e26 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/samsung,mipi-dsim.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/samsung,mipi-dsim.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ properties:
           - samsung,exynos5422-mipi-dsi
           - samsung,exynos5433-mipi-dsi
           - samsung,exynos7870-mipi-dsi
+          - samsung,exynos9820-mipi-dsi
           - fsl,imx8mm-mipi-dsim
           - fsl,imx8mp-mipi-dsim
       - items:
@@ -46,11 +47,11 @@ properties:
     const: 0
 
   clocks:
-    minItems: 2
+    minItems: 1
     maxItems: 5
 
   clock-names:
-    minItems: 2
+    minItems: 1
     maxItems: 5
 
   samsung,phy-type:
@@ -145,6 +146,41 @@ required:
 
 allOf:
   - $ref: ../dsi-controller.yaml#
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            const: samsung,exynos9820-mipi-dsi
+
+    then:
+      properties:
+        clocks:
+          minItems: 1
+          maxItems: 1
+
+        clock-names:
+          items:
+            - const: bus
+
+        ports:
+          required:
+            - port@0
+            - port@1
+
+      required:
+        - phys
+        - phy-names
+        - power-domains
+        - ports
+
+    else:
+      properties:
+        clocks:
+          minItems: 2
+
+        clock-names:
+          minItems: 2
+
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
